{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07883","headline":"久滞越中贻谢南池会稽贺少府 · 孟浩然","name":"久滞越中贻谢南池会稽贺少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陈平无产业，尼父倦东西。\n负郭昔云翳，问津今亦迷。\n未能忘魏阙，空此滞秦稽。\n两见夏云起，再闻春鸟啼。\n怀仙梅福市，访旧若耶溪。\n圣主贤爲宝，君何隐遯栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}